{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And Elohim went up from Abraham</b> — an expression of honor toward the Place. And we learn that the righteous are the merkavah of HaKadosh Baruch Hu — this is the language of Rashi (Rashi on Genesis 17:22). But their language in Bereshit Rabbah (Bereshit Rabbah 47:6) is: \"The Patriarchs — they themselves are the merkavah.\" This alludes to what is written (Micah 7:20), \"You give truth to Jacob, lovingkindness to Abraham,\" and \"the fear of Isaac was upon me\" (Genesis 31:42). And the enlightened will understand."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:30:33.146701714Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}